)

The first paragraph is the lede.

= Inline Markup

A paragraph with #emph[emphasis], #strong[strong text], "smart quotes", a
#link("https://example.com")[link], and a footnote.#footnote[The footnote body.]

#note[Library bindings are available without an import.]

== A Nested Heading

Deeper than the one before it, so the table of contents nests.

= Blocks

#table(
    columns: 2,
    table.header([Column A], [Column B]),
    [a], [b],
)

A raw block, highlighted by its language:

```go
func unrelated() {}
```

And one without a language:

```
a raw block
```

